48ac7ba5f4913fdc6877d3debb8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Well met, @playername@. I was sent with a message from King Tolak of Last Hope.\nI followed the trail of bodies that you left - very impressive! We are lucky to have you on our side.\nBut enough talk; take this message. I must go now.\n#LIGHT_GREEN#He gives you a sealed scroll and vanishes into the shadows.#LAST#","source_tag":"_t","target":"幸会，@playername@。我奉最后的希望国王托拉克之命前来送信。\n我循着你沿途留下的尸体找到了这里——真令人印象深刻！幸好你站在我们这一边。\n闲话少说；收下这封信吧。我必须走了。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#他递给你一个密封的卷轴，然后消失在阴影中。#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ded81c4b8688f64bb702805d4d59cf1ab2884285d33f159e3702031dfad5474f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7170d0e783edfb60c486f0847c99d5c2ba623a18ec46c4c5087ad4a74d655b60","logical_entry_identity":"cd758d68e7a3e95f11f0c0fd172ee8bfb6211bc72058b50c2abf8d686e0ef73f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Where is the portal?","source_tag":"_t","target":"传送门在哪里？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9b85c0a4daf2a7cd9238bac1c5d508241ae4504f28dfb9db0b83746490b11a58","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"717114df22d1af096a9fc91c98af7a814ea6e85c97af6c790532ffee6347e06e","logical_entry_identity":"b376b680415ce7605ddc94d0116a3168b15f46604145db2131431984bd14850f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shattering up to %d ghouls or ghasts you create a putrescent swirling cloud of radius %d that follows you around for 3 turns per dead ghoul plus one turn. Oldest ghouls are prioritized for destruction.\n\t\tAny ghoul or ghast dying or expiring within this cloud increases its duration by %d turn and every two absorbed ghoul/ghast your gain back one soul.\n\t\tThe cloud deals %0.2f frostdusk damage to any foes caught inside.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你粉碎最多 %d 个食尸鬼或妖鬼，在身边创造出半径 %d 码的腐败云雾，持续时间为杀死的食尸鬼数量乘 3 再加一回合。你会优先选择最老的食尸鬼。\n\t\t每个在云雾中死去的食尸鬼或妖鬼会增加它的持续时间 %d 回合，每死亡2个食尸鬼或妖鬼会恢复1点灵魂。\n\t\t云雾会对其中的所有敌人造成 %0.2f 霜暮伤害。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"db2422cc60c02c5fee77fd350f228298263a773a1cb9c379c9fdc5e9e27d7d4d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"717255da20bd645e44cea64c64a88dcd3dbd16044d6a304023579b81986e7dc2","logical_entry_identity":"6d881780cad0cfaa2fc59ee07269f25a9ca9bb82703c84524bef22e215706879","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Crawl onto the target, covering it in acid.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"攀附到目标身上，使其覆满酸液。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2db374f3972da4c3278621647a59dbcf10c32617f5d2570f31b0711fdda58f02","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7177bd08a177156c3bb891f1ace9e113d8da5dcc0c196dc3d60f9fc894f1deb1","logical_entry_identity":"2732ce7fcd9f0119c79a2b3dea46fb49f3297fd3999efc15c9a9c0bd6ae343bb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"vision","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"视觉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"10e0657f9f4c64276a49b220d12db5ea895456d098afe99555dac5f326977423","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"717918592abaa3e476e68eee231fb4b77130ff3956b4d357e49b1c1353ef7a3d","logical_entry_identity":"6e111c311582667299ac603631e61761e5c149a299a116ac21a62a777f3b19a5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Steel Helm of Garkul","source_tag":"entity name","target":"加库尔的钢盔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"562ed7eb7d7e746105b50ce72f400e10290d4f62060ce0ba8ccc750707cb299a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"717918f6422c8654b30570dcfe045c0d4a802a39cceb9b4654e8acb54f7089b7","logical_entry_identity":"cc55cca16a163c3edf03734357735237e11bd9121175152350cb8c66ed630bd1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"acid blast trap","source_tag":"entity name","target":"酸液爆炸陷阱"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}